# Rollout decision for production builds. Read by `next build` and overridden by
# any ACTIVE_PHASE set in the Vercel dashboard, so check the dashboard value too.
#
# 1 = all 39 Rhode Island municipalities (39 city hubs and 273 service x city pages).
# Copy for these 312 pages is checked in at lib/generated/city-copy.json.
#
# Do not raise this past 1 until Massachusetts and Connecticut copy has been
# generated and reviewed, and the phase gate in CLAUDE.md section 5 is met.
# lib/data/cities.ts still defaults to 0 when this is unset.
ACTIVE_PHASE=1
